Output assets/demo.gif
Output assets/demo.mp4

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1100
Set Height 680
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font"
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Type "tk"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "tk dep --cpm -A"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "tk dep --dsm -A"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "tk review -A"
Enter
Sleep 4s
